"""
Neoterra per-building identity: a colour/material theme and a hand-picked growth recipe for every hut.

The Neoterra base (white walls, glass, greenery) is shared; everything else is the building's own:

  THEMES     accent families. Each has cheap blocks for levels 1-3 and premium blocks for levels 4-5.
  BUILDINGS  per building: theme, roof forms for levels 2/3/4, level-5 crown, ground style and the
             landmark modules (with the level they appear at). No two buildings share a recipe.

Modules are implemented in signature.py, roof forms / crowns in reshape.py.
"""

# accent: replaces the cyan accent family; wall2: mixed into white walls; glass_p: premium glass;
# light_c / light_p: light blocks; trim: dark trim; feature: the landmark-module body material
